# 09 — Coding-Agent Product Layer

> **Scope**: The coding-agent product layer built on tau core — tools, skills, prompts, CLI.
> **Basis**: `01-core-design.md` (6 abstractions), `05-access-points.md` (11 APs), `03-tool-schema.md` (codegen).
> **Status**: Design phase — no Go implementation until Phase 5 IMPLEMENT.

---

## §1 — Architecture Overview

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  CLI (cmd/tau/)                                  │
│  args → SessionConfig → core.NewSession          │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Product Layer (pkg/coding/)                     │
│  Tools │ Skills │ Prompt │ Sandbox               │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Core (core/) — unchanged                        │
│  Loop │ Session │ ToolRegistry │ HookSet │ ...   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

New package: `pkg/coding/` — product layer. New binary: `cmd/tau/` — CLI entry.
Both live outside `core/`. Zero core changes needed.

