## §8 — What is NOT in Scope (v1)

| Concern | Status | Why |
|---------|--------|-----|
| TUI | Deferred to Phase 5+ | Batch mode first (CLI in → CLI out) |
| WebUI | Deferred | Multi-session only after TUI |
| Agent branching | Product layer (Transcript tree) | Core Transcript is flat by design |
| File-watcher triggers | Deferred | No evidence of need |
| Container sandbox | `BashOperations` interface planned | v1 = process-level jail |
| Extension system | Deferred | Wait for real-world usage data |

