## §9 — Core Layer Gaps

**None.** All 5 capabilities (7 tools, skills, prompt templates, CLI, access points)
fit within existing core abstractions:

- Tools → `core.Tool` + `ToolRegistry` (no new Tool interface needed)
- Skills → `SystemPromptFn` closure (already designed for this — G3)
- Prompt dynamics → `HookSet.TransformContext` (already exists)
- CLI session lifecycle → `core.NewSession` + `Loop.Prompt` (already demoed)
- Sandbox → inside `ToolExecuteFn` closure (ctx carries cancellation; closure carries workspace root)

**Zero core source file modifications required.**

